  "summary_en": "State Council Decree No. 818 promulgating regulations on clinical research and clinical translation of new biomedical technologies, effective 1 May 2026. The excerpt covers filing, ethics review, record retention, termination for adverse events, approval timelines and graduated penalties. It is not about AI or robotics.",
